#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:80
#: 2851070a1a384a4182c0f4691ef88b61
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:81
#: 2199ff7e4bce4f83a065911857e21432
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC输入配置在R2（UART2_RX）引脚，支持除PPM以外的所有RC协议。特定RC系统的详细信息请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:83
#: 09a85c6d568c42f3a8978fcf73c9bf5f
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需连接T2，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:85
#: ca6ff7071698459ea727e23f3a917ec5
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R2外，还需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:87
#: 0d7851b8750f4adbbdb71dcb4632a80f
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:89
#: f2d4a322cd704d34bda19fad8b4e1c62
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:92
#: 93ff124d7dc0452c8f575019e005e28e
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:94
#: cd035d923ce14a82a81044d518739330
msgid ""
"The autopilot  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used "
"simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""
"飞控支持通过 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456驱动）使用OSD。默认配置同时支持通过UART4使用DJI "
"Goggle OSD。通过将 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` 设置为5，可同时使用内置模拟OSD和DisplayPort "
"OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:98
#: c5e5bc0360d84605a6abd71ff2c10af3
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:99
#: 67d634dcf3ed418fab53ec7a5cb8dd6d
msgid ""
"The BLITZ H743 Pro has 13 PWM outputs. The first 8 outputs support bi-"
"directional DShot and DShot, as well as all PWM types. Outputs 9-10 support "
"DShot, as well as all PWM types and outputs 11-12 only support PWM. Output "
"13 is pre-configured for serial LED."
msgstr ""
"BLITZ H743 Pro "
"共有13路PWM输出。前8路输出支持双向DShot和DShot及所有PWM类型。输出9-10支持DShot及所有PWM类型，输出11-12仅支持PWM。输出13预配置为串行LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:101
#: 65bc3b40e0af47229b3659da50c8cf8a
msgid "The PWM are in in five groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为五组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:104
#: 6f95d795b249405bb868a657b1b421e5
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:105
#: a1841727dff74b08bfc706996d213d31
msgid "PWM 3-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-6 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:106
#: 62796f292bc04307a4726f45117881e0
msgid "PWM 7-10 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-10 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:107
#: 83aa52f3c83c4a46ba33f6ac1ec54931
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 11-12 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:108
#: 6a12aa7f40aa41f6854d4bae45a0750a
msgid "PWM 13 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 13 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:110
#: 1fade0d8e1864da6bb4fe773b39ac1ce
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:114
#: 4c20295b88924a4eb91c71dde3327203
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:116
#: cc96b2c0b54049928b6a0e2b74bcb714
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:117
#: f0d6a08c38024d9ebaab49c5ce9c5032
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:120
#: 3a02c1a01d5c4d20b80641a4fdf15667
msgid "Video Power Control"
msgstr "视频电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:122
#: 0fd2ae3f93534fdab8f1872f8d6c8f45
msgid ""
"The 12V video power can be turned off/on  using GPIO 81 which is already "
"assigned by default to RELAY2.  This relay can be controlled either from the"
" GCS or using a transmitter channel (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`)"
msgstr ""
"12V视频电源可通过GPIO 81进行开关控制，该GPIO默认已分配给RELAY2。此继电器可通过地面站或遥控器通道进行控制（参见 "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:125
#: 21e7c439594b4b65870473b4923ad65c
msgid "RSSI Input"
msgstr "RSSI输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:127
#: 67ca1342bc084ae8b9c1e67368452a0a
msgid ""
"The analog airspeed pin is \"4\" and is marked \"RSSI\" on the expansion "
"board."
msgstr "模拟空速引脚为 「4」，在扩展板上标注为 「RSSI」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:130
#: fb0ad29edb584dfaa53874738341167e
