#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:147
#: 61558ccbb2134271bbe0e699b6c6f397
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:149
#: 998a6d25b1e346108fa0ab00f85fa37c
msgid ""
"The BLITZ Wing H743 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass to I2C pins."
msgstr "BLITZ Wing H743 无内置罗盘，但可通过I2C引脚连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:153
#: ccf1c59240ee40eb8203b86fe3b5a5c0
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:155
#: ec7f03f87ce24573ba9b6239dc9461be
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"BlitzH74Pro\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 「BlitzH74Pro」 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:158
#: 313e046e43e845729d6f30cc82e3ae0f
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:160
#: de20c2e5b5d04f4c994496d55d069cda
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743pro.rst:164
#: 4c83e8b103264b94940b15634110c632
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
